              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi wauka phamwenga na atue achendaolaga Afilisti magana mairi. Masunyu gao wagareha, achimupha mfalume isabu kamili, ili akale mtsedza wa mfalume. Kpwa hivyo Sauli achimlóza Daudi mwanawe mchetu, Mikali.",
          "type": "text",
